  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/10/P1200708.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21.3333px; orphans: auto; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 1; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; display: inline !important; float: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(224 fotos) Nombroses persones han participat la nit d&#39;aquest dilluns, dins de les festes patronals de Suera, en la process&oacute; del Crist de la Clem&egrave;ncia fins al calvari, on el mat&iacute; d&#39;aquest dimarts s&#39;han bene&iuml;t els congrets i s&#39;ha celebrat missa a c&agrave;rrec del p&agrave;rroc Jos&eacute; Pla Espinosa, predicada per&nbsp;Jos&eacute; Luis Garc&iacute;a Suller, canonge de la Cocatedral de Castell&oacute;.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; line-height: 21.33px; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; font-variant: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: normal; widows: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"></span></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processonsfestesoctubresuera/img_7956.jpg\" alt=\"img_7956\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processonsfestesoctubresuera/img_7959.jpg\" alt=\"img_7959\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processonsfestesoctubresuera/p1200380.jpg\" alt=\"p1200380\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><i